<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - US Industries cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - US Industries cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs said it lowered its rating on US Industries Inc, removing the stock from the firm's recommendation list, now rating it a market outperform.</p>
<p>-- Shares were off 3/4 to 31-7/8 in morning NYSE trade.</p>
</text>
